\ls4\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Hybrid Retrieval Router
\f4\b0  \'97 Route questions to vectors (simple lookups), graph (multi\uc0\u8209 hop/counting), or both; start with 20\'9630 curated examples.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Multi\uc0\u8209 Role File Injection
\f4\b0  \'97 Tag content by role/domain (policy, broker, member, legal) and prefer role\uc0\u8209 aligned context at query time to reduce hallucinations.\
